# Stanxx

This project was reimplement NATS server using CPP. This project is just for learning purpose, there is no plan for being professional project.

## Dependency
- Linux, this only avalable for linux only
- Seastar, compile and install to your system. https://github.com/scylladb/seastar
- `apt install libgtest-dev libspdlog-dev libbenchmark-dev libgmock-dev nlohmann-json3-dev clangd`

## VSCode
`.vscode/settings.json`
```json
{
    "cmake.configureOnOpen": false,
    "cmake.options.statusBarVisibility": "visible",
    "cmake.pinnedCommands": [
        "workbench.action.tasks.configureTaskRunner",
        "workbench.action.tasks.runTask"
    ],
    "C_Cpp.intelliSenseEngine": "disabled",
    "cmake.configureEnvironment": {},
    "cmake.configureOnEdit": false,
    "cmake.configureArgs": [
        "-DCMAKE_MODULE_PATH=[your-seastar-folder]/seastar/cmake",
        "-DCMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS=1"
    ],
    "cmake.copyCompileCommands": "${workspaceFolder}/compile_commands.json"
}
```

## Benchmark
```bash
$ nats bench pub --msgs=10000 --size="256" --clients=1 hello.world
08:38:20 Starting Core NATS publish benchmark [clients=1, msg-size=256 B, msgs=10,000, multi-subject=false, multi-subject-max=100,000, sleep=0s, subject=hello.world]
08:38:20 Starting publisher, publishing 10,000 messages

Pub stats: 5,837,050 msgs/sec ~ 1.39 GB/sec
```